WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:04.840
Make her feel like you're someone 
who needs to be shown to the world!

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.230
Make her eat her damn words!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.750
Luou! Please, open up!

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:10.950
Wake up!

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:14.240
You have to live and dance!

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.740
It'll piss me off!

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.030
It's unlocked...

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.750
Luou?

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:31.760
Maybe he went to the home 
where Grandmother's living.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:36.050
If we leave him be, 
he might not come home.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:10.310
Act 10: "Miyako... You Need to Be by His Side"

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.480
84-453-3-7-8 Asugaya-nantou,
Suginami-ku, Tokyo
 To: Mori Luou c/o Godai 
Home Hinemosu 3-chome, 
Kuragamauji, Kanagawa

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.480
Search Results

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.480
Ogikubo

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.480
Shinjuku

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.480
Musashi-Kosugi

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.480
We should be there in an hour and a half.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.160
It'll be too late...

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.740
You mean, for the variation performances?

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.050
You should go back and do 
your performance, at least!

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:23.620
No, like I said, I'm not going.

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:27.460
Did Ayako-san say something to you?

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:29.120
Were you scouted for the SS class?

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.960
Of course not.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.960
More importantly, who's this "Grandmother"?

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.060
Grandmother is...

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.730
Back when Russia was the Soviet Union,

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:47.470
she tried to become a top prima 
ballerina there, but didn't make it.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:52.560
Back then, it was even more unheard of 
for an Asian person to perform in Russia.

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:56.190
On top of that, she got injured.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:59.710
She was summoned back 
to Japan by your grandfather,

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.460
got married, and had me.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:06.880
But she probably thought 
that since I'm full Japanese,

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:11.580
she wouldn't be able to entrust her 
dream of being the top in Russia to me.

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:14.400
A few months after I was born,

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:19.350
she left me and went to Russia, and got 
pregnant with a Russian dancer's child.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:26.890
That child was your aunt Mazuru, who was 
a scandal-ridden idol, not a ballerina.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:31.980
And then, at some point, Mazuru left 
your grandmother to care for...

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.980
Luou!

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.440
I get to meet him today, right?

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.280
When can we start living together?

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:41.110
Given your grandmother's current state, 
I think it'd be better for us to take him...

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.110
But I can't get a hold of Mazuru.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:50.200
Go home. Next time, send 
the money by registered mail.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:54.210
No, no. I'm not here to give you 
money for living expenses.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:57.510
I got another call from 
Luou's elementary school.

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.170
You've been keeping him at home, haven't you?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:04.420
I told you. He's being bullied 
because of Mazuru.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:06.260
Huh? <i>That's</i> why?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.800
Mazuru neglected her child,

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:11.170
and you've kept him shut inside, not 
sending him to kindergarten or preschool.

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:14.350
How's he supposed to know how 
to make friends like that?

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.320
Is that your daughter?

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.230
Nice to meet you. I'm Godai Miyako...

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.260
You know it's impossible, don't you?

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.280
For a Japanese person to do ballet.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.010
Because ballet is European.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:48.620
Stop that.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.550
RIght now, she's just having fun dancing.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.480
She's not thinking about 
going pro or anything.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.180
Miyako, go wait over there for bit.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:04.110
<i>For a second, Grandmother looked like 
the Lilac Fairy from </i>The Sleeping Beauty<i>,</i>

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:07.610
<i>but she was actually Carabosse, 
who lives in the haunted house.</i>

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:12.620
<i>But she seemed like the 
real thing, like Mommy...</i>

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:16.370
<i>I don't understand how you 
can be so unambitious.</i>

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.380
<i>I don't feel anything from you that says,</i>

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.740
<i>"I want to stand out more than anyone!"</i>

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:21.450
<i>or "I want to be the best!"</i>

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.330
<i>For as long as I can remember,</i>

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.880
<i>I've had my heart set on 
making a living doing ballet.</i>

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:29.010
<i>You don't feel anything like that?</i>

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.020
<i>I do </i>like<i> ballet...</i>

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:37.680
Now, now. Kids usually have 
lots of different dreams.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:42.900
<i>Yeah. That's right, Daddy. I'm still a kid.</i>

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:48.580
Ta-da! Souvenirs from Daddy's business trip.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.120
<b>Usual Snacks
-Sweet Chestnuts 
-Rice Crackers 
-Sweet Potatoes</b>

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.240
Mommy'll get mad if she sees these colors.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.530
So pretty!

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:00.040
Luou!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:02.610
You're Luou, right?!

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.920
I'm your cousin, Miyako!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.170
Hey, do you want some gummies?

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:10.360
You're not allowed to eat 
pretty candy, either?

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.550
That's the same as me!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.580
What kind of fruit is this?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.830
<i>A-A prince? Speaking Russian?</i>

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.580
Huh? Why aren't you wearing clothes?

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.840
Because I had a lesson.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.390
Oh, Japanese...

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:47.840
Grandmother said it's so she can check 
if I'm using my body correctly.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.090
Miyako!

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.860
Where are you?! We're leaving!

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.820
Y-You have to go!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.820
Ugh, this is pointless!

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:56.600
Grandmother will be mad!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:57.980
Wait!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.480
Can I come over again?

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.480
I'll bring more pretty candies!

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:07.500
At noon, Grandmother takes 
medicine and goes to sleep,

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.580
and doesn't wake up for about two hours.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:16.620
<i>On days I didn't have school, I would 
diligently bring over forbidden snacks.</i>

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:19.210
<i>I'd play the piano,</i>

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.500
<i>and Luou would dance whatever he wanted.</i>

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.450
A sissonne ouverte's like...

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.530
this?

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:27.960
Wow, Miyako...

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.020
You haven't learned that yet?

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:35.000
The boys in my class do jumps and 
turns like this all the time, though...

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:40.890
Grandmother says I can't do 
turns or big jumps yet.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:44.360
I have to work on my flexibility 
and standing properly first.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:48.590
Your mom ended up only being 
good enough to dance in Japan.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.610
That's why she went back to Oikawa, right?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.150
Let's learn from Grandmother together!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:56.960
If you don't, you'll end up like your mom.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.480
I'm going home.

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:02.090
Come back and see me.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:03.620
I don't know if I will.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.700
If you don't, I'll take Grandmother's medicine.

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:10.730
If I take a lot of them, then I'll die.

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.880
Stupid! Spit them out!

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:17.100
<i>Both Luou's dancing and his 
mental state were unstable.</i>

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.520
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:23.390
You're cheating again, 
trying to find the easy way out!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.390
It hurts...

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:24.810
Stop crying!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.400
Don't irritate me even more 
with that hopeless body of yours!

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.810
I said stop crying!

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:37.430
<i>Grandmother's lessons were so, so scary...</i>

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.990
Mazuru could do it all from the start!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:44.750
This would make me hate ballet...

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.810
<i>But there was nowhere for Luou to run.</i>

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:49.880
<i>It was all he knew.</i>

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:53.880
<i>Even when Grandmother 
was sleeping, he kept dancing...</i>

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:54.880
<i>with a smile.</i>

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.390
Miyako, teach me how to do a pirouette.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:03.410
<i>Oh, I see. This is the only 
time he can enjoy ballet.</i>

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.140
<i>The time he lives for.</i>

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.400
<i>I have to come here as much as I can.</i>

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.780
<i>I have to protect Luou!</i>

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:18.120
What? You started learning jumps?

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:22.390
No. I have a lot more lessons with 
both hands on the barre, though.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.920
Grandmother said that 
if I do the barre properly,

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:29.220
then when I'm ready to do jumps, 
I'll have the right muscles for it.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.520
<i>There aren't any boys our age...</i>

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:37.800
<i>or girls, for that matter... 
who are this graceful.</i>

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:40.350
<i>No one dances so well 
with the music, either.</i>

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:44.300
<i>It's like he lives in the kingdom of ballet.</i>

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:49.100
<i>Was Grandmother right?</i>

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.730
<b>Oikawa Haruka Ballet Company
 Oikawa Haruka Ballet School</b>

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.140
Miyako-chan,

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:54.010
you haven't registered 
for the pointe class yet.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:58.740
Oh, I wouldn't make it to piano and
 gymnastics on some of the days...

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.540
I see. But if you want to 
be a professional dancer,

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.540
you'll have to choose sooner or later.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:08.310
I don't think I can become a pro...

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:12.630
That's not true. You're 
Chizuru-san's daughter!

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:16.480
I heard she's going to perform in <i>Don Quixote</i>.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.630
She <i>is</i> from the Oikawa family, after all.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.000
I wonder what the audition was.

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:23.010
<i>But just standing at the barre... 
she's totally different...</i>

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.390
<i>She seems like the real thing.</i>

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.360
Pointe class?

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.670
You can take it if you want,

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:31.150
but if you'd rather do 
something else, that's fine, too.

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:36.320
After teaching the SS class, it's like, 
"Can't they just have fun dancing?"

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:40.650
The kids who have potential 
already know that, though.

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:45.590
<i>Someone like me, who doesn't have much 
potential, can only dance for fun...</i>

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.460
Miyako, you're not gonna eat any?

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:49.550
No.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:52.600
You've only been playing piano recently. 
You haven't been dancing.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.800
It's fine. I'm here to practice piano.

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:59.290
<i>Luou can dance without hesitation. 
He's too bright to look at.</i>

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:03.860
<i>I can't even choose ballet. 
How can I dance in front of him?</i>

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:07.680
Miyako, you can't be 
the top in Russia like that.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.810
Th-There's no way...

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.730
You know, Miyako...

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.640
"If you skip your lesson 
one day, you will know.

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.950
If you skip two days, 
your fellow dancers will know.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.200
If you skip three days, 
the audience can tell."

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.560
That's what Grandmoth—

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.200
That's a famous quote by Morishita Yoko-san!

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.260
Who's that?

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.060
Jeez, Grandmother!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:31.080
That's rich from someone who looks 
down so much on Japanese ballet!

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:34.530
<i>You're</i> weird for getting 
angry all of a sudden.

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:37.510
And <i>you're</i> weird for not going to school!

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.800
Here, Miyako. Don't tell Mommy.

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:47.960
It's boring eating them by myself...

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.930
Luou should just come here.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.160
<i>You win...</i>

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.310
<i>What? It's locked?</i>

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:09.950
<i>Oh, no! He always unlocked it for me...</i>

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.200
Luou! Open up!

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.420
Luou, please! Wake up!

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:22.970
Open up, Luou!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.370
No, no! Luou!

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.000
You're the real thing!

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.300
Please! I'll do anything!

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:38.580
There was a spider in the lesson room,

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:41.370
and when I put it in the jar, 
it stopped moving.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.360
Then, when I threw it outside, 
it started moving again.

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:49.140
So I climbed the tree to chase it, 
and then you showed up.

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:58.780
<i>What a soft plié...</i>

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.250
<i>He's like a cat.</i>

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:03.710
Luou!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:05.760
You have to keep dancing.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:07.540
Always.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.260
<i>The real thing...</i>

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.620
<i>Luou!</i>

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:14.520
I want you to keep dancing, too.

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.420
You'll always keep dancing with me, right?

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:23.650
It's the first time anyone's ever 
said they wanted me to dance.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.890
But I...

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:28.040
<i>I'm not the real thing.</i>

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.500
Huh? You won't?

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.660
I... want to... dance!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:39.910
<i>Flowers...</i>

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:41.670
<i>on the thorny bush!</i>

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.680
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:54.330
You started saying you wanted to go 
to school because of her, right?

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.690
That's fine. You can go live with her.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.940
If you're going to go, go now.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.950
If you come back into this room, things 
will go back to how they were before.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.090
Luou!

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:14.780
You may never see that girl again.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:17.910
I understand...

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.210
Luou, you're there, aren't you?

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:32.180
Listen, I've decided.

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:34.090
I'll become a princess.

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:36.370
Then I can be paired with you, right?

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:38.010
And stay by your side forever.

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:39.560
I'll protect you.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.240
So you can always have fun while dancing.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:44.180
Listen, Luou...

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:48.020
<i>But in the end, I wasn't good enough 
to become the princess,</i>

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.800
<i>and I stopped visiting as much...</i>

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.080
Wait.. Why am I talking about this?

00:14:56.770 --> 00:15:00.750
<i>Did I say too much?</i>

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:08.190
After that, Grandmother's 
dementia got increasingly worse,

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:10.920
and Luou shoplifted some 
snacks from the store.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.350
So he ended up coming to stay with us...

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:17.860
Oh, yeah. I still want Luou to keep dancing.

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:21.310
That's why I totally understood 
when you said it'd make you mad.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.520
Hey...

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:26.860
Both in the past and now, 
Luou's only ever had you, right?

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:28.930
He had Grandmoth—

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:33.200
Your grandmother never saw <i>Luou</i>. 
She always saw <i>Mazuru</i>.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:36.440
You were his only warmth. His only light.

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:37.990
That's...

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:42.020
And I put that light out.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:46.580
I heard that Luou saw us kiss.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:49.080
That Luou likes you.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.380
No way! There's no way.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.890
We've barely talked, even when
 we started living togeth—

00:15:54.880 --> 00:16:00.270
Miyako... You need to be by his side...

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:01.770
Huh?

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:05.520
What about... us?

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:10.530
<i>The next stop is Hinemosu-hama. Those going 
to Home Hinemosu, please use this stop...</i>

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.520
Miyako, you're so fast—

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:26.080
Mmmko?

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:30.200
I was really happy! 
About a lot of stuff with you!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:35.230
I thought I could like you 
as much as I wanted!

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.150
I was so happy!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.460
Sorry.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.990
Sorry, Miyako...

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.980
Luou wasn't in his room, so I'm 
going to check the home where
 Grandmother lives.   -Miyako

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.490
<i>I made her cry...</i>

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:02.500
Have you ever visited the 
home your grandma's at?

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.740
Yeah.

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:07.460
It's by the ocean. It's like a hotel.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:13.260
It's that cream-colored building.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:17.790
Jumpei?!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.010
This music!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.960
Huh?! Music?!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:23.740
It's from <i>Swan Lake</i>!

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.620
Odile?!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:49.270
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:52.000
This is a variation for girls!

00:17:52.850 --> 00:17:54.630
<i>What're you doing...</i>

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.880
<i>with that expression on your face?!</i>

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:58.350
Luou!

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.640
It makes Grandmother happy.

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:08.220
It's the variation that woman was good at.

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:13.900
Excellent.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.910
That's excellent, Mazuru-chan.

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.810
Excellent.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.870
Excellent!

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.850
Hey, let's go back!

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:28.160
If you leave now, you might still make it 
for the variation performances!

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:31.540
I'm not going.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.560
You have to!

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:35.420
You can't be like this.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:39.680
You have to go where you can be 
acknowledged for being yourself!

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:52.230
Luou!

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:53.870
Go home!

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:57.940
This is the first time Grandmother's 
actually, finally praising me!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.480
Amazing...

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:03.580
You're amazing, Mazuru-chan.

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:11.000
Oh, excellent!

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:12.470
You can't do it in the sand.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.210
Luou!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.630
If you're gonna dance, do Rothbart!

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:24.350
Let's do what we did on stage 
and show your grandma!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:32.020
<i>Luou doesn't need to be recognized by 
Oikawa, or the ballet world, or society,</i>

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.300
<i>but by the one who put the curse on him.</i>

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.030
Rothbart?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.310
Yeah! Granny, do you wanna see it?

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:43.050
Did you know how to dance that?

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.790
What should I do?

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.790
It's amazing, Granny!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:51.560
When Luou dances, he changes 
everything around him!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:54.420
<i>Back then...</i>

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.410
<i>Didn't you feel something, too?</i>

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:05.580
Luou's Rothbart is really amazing, 
so you should watch, okay, Granny?

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.590
<i>What is he saying?</i>

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:06.180
<i>I told him to go home. 
Why's he just barging in like this?</i>

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.270
I'm borrowing this.

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:11.810
Let's see... I don't know what it's called.

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:15.210
Jumpei, let me see that. I'll find the song.

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:16.560
Oh, thanks.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.210
Miya...ko...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.180
<i>Wait, we can't in front of Luou...</i>

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.590
Jumpei.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.640
I'm sorry.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:50.690
Thanks.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.810
You were right.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:57.610
Miya...

00:20:58.930 --> 00:20:59.980
<i>Again?</i>

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.610
<i>Are you going to get in my way...</i>

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:07.080
<i>just like before?</i>

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:12.170
You're in the way.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:14.370
If you're not going to 
perform, then move back.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.590
Mazuru could...

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:16.960
Mazuru was more...

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.330
К чёрту!

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:23.150
К чёрту! К чёрту!

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:26.090
<i>Wai—</i>

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:36.020
This is a charade!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.040
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:21.340 --> 00:23:24.040
Just one layer of skin is keeping 
all my emotions from bursting out.

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:26.540
Collecting everything into a certain shape.

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:33.390
<i>Dance Dance Danseur</i>, Act 11: 
"Oh, I Think I Love Classical Ballet."

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:35.010
Act 11
 "Oh, I Think I Love Classical Ballet"
